    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27994" root="عتم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْتُومٌ</span></b>  A camel <i>slow in journeying.</i> (K, * TA.)
And A man <i>bulky, big-bodied:</i> (K, * TA:) but
J mentions, on the authority of As, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَلٌ عَيْثُومٌ</span>,
[as meaning <i>a great camel,</i>] with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ث</span>. (TA.)

